        "axiom_use": "AC is assumed and consumed through the enough-injectives embedding inside the ordinary-operations lemma (via [[lem-bounded-analytic-field-sheaves-have-derived-tensor-hom-and-pullback-pushforward-adjunctions]]), through [[lem-c-soft-field-sheaves-are-compact-support-acyclic]] and through the choice-dependent bounded-above flat resolution [[lem-abelian-sheaves-admit-bounded-above-flat-resolutions]] used to construct the generator complex. The support and stalk arguments are otherwise choice-free.",
