        "axiom_use": "AC is assumed and consumed through the geometric suppliers [[lem-complex-algebraic-stratifications-have-finite-conical-cochain-models]] and [[lem-finite-simplicial-constructible-sheaves-have-a-derived-incidence-model]] and through the injective/cochain models of the three analytic theorems. Every remaining step is a finite-dimensional or canonical comparison and is choice-free.",
