        "axiom_use": "AC is assumed and consumed through the six-operation and geometric suppliers of [[lem-analytic-constructible-sheaves-admit-coherent-six-operations]] and [[lem-complex-algebraic-stratifications-have-finite-conical-cochain-models]]. The recollement, duality-exchange, heart and finite-length arguments are otherwise choice-free.",
