              "title": "A. A. Beilinson, J. Bernstein, P. Deligne, Faisceaux pervers, Asterisque 100 (1982); SS1.4 recollement t-structures and SS2.1 perverse sheaves on stratified spaces",
              "url": "https://www.numdam.org/item/AST_1982__100__1_0.pdf"
