              "url": "https://www.math.tau.ac.il/~bernstei/Publication_list/publication_texts/luntz_ESF/3-derived-category-and-functors.pdf"
            }
          ]
        },
        "axiom_use": "AC is assumed and consumed through [[thm-ordinary-middle-perverse-t-structure-glues-and-has-simple-intersection-complexes]], [[lem-analytic-constructible-sheaves-admit-coherent-six-operations]] and the geometric stratification theorem [[thm-complex-algebraic-varieties-and-maps-admit-compatible-finite-stratifications]]. The dimension count, duality and reflection arguments are otherwise choice-free.",
        "dependency_level": 20
